{"id":"76b8cfaf4d1fb58a","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-pcp-list-grammars.md","title":"PCP 两张列表对应的文法","display":"df-pcp-list-grammars — PCP 两张列表对应的文法","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-pcp-list-grammars","aliases":["73-df-pcp-list-grammars"],"display":"df-pcp-list-grammars — PCP 两张列表对应的文法","depends_on":["[[73-df-pcp-and-modified-pcp-solutions]]","[[73-df-cfg-structure]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§9.5.2, print pp. 413–415; PDF pp. 435–437; explicit natural-number symbol allocation","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":9},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-pcp-list-grammars"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-pcp-list-grammars</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pcp-list-grammars — PCP 两张列表对应的文法"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ef2510d5b7c48e0c\" href=\"?note=ef2510d5b7c48e0c\" title=\"73-df-pcp-and-modified-pcp-solutions\">73-df-pcp-and-modified-pcp-solutions</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"33052f37223a11c6\" href=\"?note=33052f37223a11c6\" title=\"73-df-cfg-structure\">73-df-cfg-structure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§9.5.2, print pp. 413–415; PDF pp. 435–437; explicit natural-number symbol allocation"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"9"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in(\\mathbf2^+\\times\\mathbf2^+)^k\">\\(I\\in(\\mathbf2^+\\times\\mathbf2^+)^k\\)</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}\">\\(i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_i=\\pi_1(I(i))\">\\(u_i=\\pi_1(I(i))\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_i=\\pi_2(I(i))\">\\(v_i=\\pi_2(I(i))\\)</span>，采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ef2510d5b7c48e0c\" href=\"?note=ef2510d5b7c48e0c\" title=\"73-df-pcp-and-modified-pcp-solutions\">73-df-pcp-and-modified-pcp-solutions</a> 的同一实例。索引字符 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_i\">\\(a_i\\)</span>、变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,S\">\\(A,B,S\\)</span> 及终结字母表 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 在下式用自然数构造。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a_i\\coloneqq i+2\\quad(0\\le i&lt;k),\\qquad A\\coloneqq k+2,\\quad B\\coloneqq k+3,\\quad S\\coloneqq k+4,\\qquad T\\coloneqq\\{0,1\\}\\cup\\{a_i:0\\le i&lt;k\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a_i\\coloneqq i+2\\quad(0\\le i&lt;k),\\qquad A\\coloneqq k+2,\\quad B\\coloneqq k+3,\\quad S\\coloneqq k+4,\\qquad T\\coloneqq\\{0,1\\}\\cup\\{a_i:0\\le i&lt;k\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P_A\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i=0}^{k-1}\\{(A,u_i\\langle A,a_i\\rangle),(A,u_i\\langle a_i\\rangle)\\},\\quad\nP_B\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i=0}^{k-1}\\{(B,v_i\\langle B,a_i\\rangle),(B,v_i\\langle a_i\\rangle)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P_A\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i=0}^{k-1}\\{(A,u_i\\langle A,a_i\\rangle),(A,u_i\\langle a_i\\rangle)\\},\\quad\nP_B\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i=0}^{k-1}\\{(B,v_i\\langle B,a_i\\rangle),(B,v_i\\langle a_i\\rangle)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G_A(I)\\coloneqq(\\{A\\},T,P_A,A),\\quad\nG_B(I)\\coloneqq(\\{B\\},T,P_B,B),\\quad\nG_{AB}(I)\\coloneqq(\\{S,A,B\\},T,P_A\\cup P_B\\cup\\{(S,\\langle A\\rangle),(S,\\langle B\\rangle)\\},S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G_A(I)\\coloneqq(\\{A\\},T,P_A,A),\\quad\nG_B(I)\\coloneqq(\\{B\\},T,P_B,B),\\quad\nG_{AB}(I)\\coloneqq(\\{S,A,B\\},T,P_A\\cup P_B\\cup\\{(S,\\langle A\\rangle),(S,\\langle B\\rangle)\\},S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>索引字符与二进制字符分离，三个变量也不与终结符重合。索引出现在产生式末尾，因此在生成词中按选择次序反向排列；这个反向尾部是恢复推导的证书。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-pcp-and-modified-pcp-solutions","status":"resolved","id":"ef2510d5b7c48e0c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-pcp-and-modified-pcp-solutions]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-structure","status":"resolved","id":"33052f37223a11c6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-pcp-and-modified-pcp-solutions","status":"resolved","id":"ef2510d5b7c48e0c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$，$I\\in(\\mathbf2^+\\times\\mathbf2^+)^k$；对 $i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}$，$u_i=\\pi_1(I(i))$、$v_i=\\pi_2(I(i))$，采用 [[73-df-pcp-and-modified-pcp-solutions]] 的同一实例。索引字符 $a_i$、变量 $A,B,S$ 及终结字母表 $T$ 在下式用自然数构造。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"I\\in(\\mathbf2^+\\times\\mathbf2^+)^k","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"u_i=\\pi_1(I(i))","display":false},{"tex":"v_i=\\pi_2(I(i))","display":false},{"tex":"a_i","display":false},{"tex":"A,B,S","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"a_i\\coloneqq i+2\\quad(0\\le i<k),\\qquad A\\coloneqq k+2,\\quad B\\coloneqq k+3,\\quad S\\coloneqq k+4,\\qquad T\\coloneqq\\{0,1\\}\\cup\\{a_i:0\\le i<k\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"P_A\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i=0}^{k-1}\\{(A,u_i\\langle A,a_i\\rangle),(A,u_i\\langle a_i\\rangle)\\},\\quad\nP_B\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i=0}^{k-1}\\{(B,v_i\\langle B,a_i\\rangle),(B,v_i\\langle a_i\\rangle)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"G_A(I)\\coloneqq(\\{A\\},T,P_A,A),\\quad\nG_B(I)\\coloneqq(\\{B\\},T,P_B,B),\\quad\nG_{AB}(I)\\coloneqq(\\{S,A,B\\},T,P_A\\cup P_B\\cup\\{(S,\\langle A\\rangle),(S,\\langle B\\rangle)\\},S).","display":true}],"bytes":1822,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-207","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-pcp-list-grammars|PCP 两张列表对应的文法]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"65f79fdc4c47ee8b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$I,T,G_A(I),G_B(I)$ 采用 [[73-df-pcp-list-grammars]]；$\\mathsf{DCFL}_T$ 采用 [[73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton]] 的终态接受版本。"},{"id":"ddee155bb5d30192","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$，$I\\in(\\mathbf2^+\\times\\mathbf2^+)^k$；$T,a_i,A,B,G_A(I),G_B(I)$ 采用 [[73-df-pcp-list-grammars]] 对该同一 $I$ 的构造，$U_I,V_I$ 为其两行串接函数。$\\iota\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}^{<\\omega}$，$X\\in\\{A,B\\}$；$\\operatorname{Idx}$ 及索引族 $\\mathcal G_I,W$ 在下式定义。"}],"outgoing":["ef2510d5b7c48e0c","33052f37223a11c6"]}